# Seam edges between a sweep's pieces (mitcad#2148, GitHub mitcad/Mitcad#516)
# on the reported design of the private test files (MITCAD_MITCAD_REPORTED,
# github-515/; never committed): the line-and-arc sweep mirrored in a plane
# through its straight part and joined (F3.b0), the copy's torus branching
# off the shared cylinder. The circle between the cylinder and the torus is
# drawn on the original as on the copy; the counts are logged.
# Run by tools/ui-seam-edges-test.sh when the design is there.
expect-ever 'View area'
wait-idle

expect-view-seams F3.b0 4+ 1+
